  Codewhale cloud box
  -------------------
  codewhale     start Codewhale (/provider to connect a model, /model to pick one)
  cw            same, inside a detachable tmux session (tmux attach -t codewhale to resume)
  codewhale exec "task"   run one task headless
  gh auth login GitHub CLI
  ~/            persisted on the volume (repos, config, dotfiles survive redeploys)

